the margins of the war but he saw how a military operated not from the top down but from the bottom

00:31:26.560 --> 00:31:29.970
up, and one of his favorite expressions was

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:36.940
the military screws up everything. PT-109 Skipper did little to distinguish himself

