00:33:20.960 --> 00:33:23.980
And when he gets up on the beach, he collapses.

00:33:30.570 --> 00:33:37.230
The men who were with Kennedy that day, they all speak of his sense of responsibility,

00:33:37.230 --> 00:33:44.560
that it was his job, that he would spare no effort to try and get help for his crew.

00:33:47.570 --> 00:33:51.520
It took a week, but Kennedy did manage to get his crew rescued.

00:33:53.560 --> 00:33:58.680
Fortunately, he wrote to his father, they misjudged the durability of a Kennedy.

00:34:01.240 --> 00:34:05.590
