00:34:06.330 --> 00:34:11.740
And when he arrived at his parents' winter home in Palm Beach, his weight was down to around 120.

00:34:13.260 --> 00:34:16.960
His back was so bad, he needed a brace and a cane to walk.

00:34:21.790 --> 00:34:23.270
But he was also a war hero.

00:34:24.090 --> 00:34:28.210
The Navy had made a public display of putting two medals on his bony chest.

00:34:30.350 --> 00:34:35.730
And the story of PT-109 made great copy, read by millions.

00:34:40.450 --> 00:34:43.650
The country needs heroes at this point in the war.

00:34:44.770 --> 00:34:47.880
And so Jack, in a sense, fills that role.

00:34:49.110 --> 00:34:53.560
Here is this wealthy son of the famous ambassador to Britain

00:34:53.560 --> 00:34:56.780
who didn't have to go into this kind of combat service.

00:34:57.030 --> 00:34:59.970
And they don't talk about the fact that maybe his seamanship was...

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:08.260
in some ways deficient in that his boat was cut in half. His brother, who was in London as an

00:35:08.260 --> 00:35:15.170
