00:36:06.150 --> 00:36:09.190
The depth of his father's despair was unsettling.

00:36:10.800 --> 00:36:15.880
There is something about the firstborn that sets him a little apart, Joe Sr. wrote.

00:36:16.960 --> 00:36:20.280
You know what great things I saw in the future for him.

